      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FABERGE TZAR (2) disappointed last start at Darwin when on the quick turnaround but his form prior makes for good reading. The blinkers go back on today as he drops in trip and Darwin's leading hoop now hops on board. Maps to get every chance and he looks the one to beat. CANGGU (5) showed good early dash and raced on the speed last start before fading to finish in seventh over 1435m at this track. Rates highly and expected to go well. BIG SHOTS (1) has been in the money at his last couple of runs, the latest when second over 1435m at this track. One of the main contenders. SEMPRE (3) finished third at this track two runs back but was less effective last time over 1200m at this track, finishing 3.5 lengths back in seventh. Looks well placed so expect a better run this time. BONDI QUEEN (8) can bounce back to her best getting back to the scene of her win three starts ago.",
